BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Questionable - SAPPHIC OVER 30 EDITION : Queer Singles Trivia
DTSTART:20260617T193000
DTEND:20260617T193000
UID:f478104e4ab716b088b74b47b5dbc7a5@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Join us at GROUND CONTROL. This edition is for sapphics 30 yea
 rs or older. Always trans and enby inclusive. Tired of the apps? Is Toront
 o a tough place to meet new people? Try this! QUESTIONABLE is trivia with 
 a twist…. Already have what you&#x27\;re looking for but have a friend w
 ho you want to set up? Come pitch them! This is our SAPPHIC EDITION. Alway
 s trans and enby inclusive. Come be part of the series that has become the
  stuff of legends..... THIS IS OUR 30+ EDITION for GROWN sapphics who are 
 30 and up! This event is at GROUND CONTROL 1279 Queen Street West Doors at
  7:30pm First Round starts at 8pm Hosted by your faves: @chaodykes How doe
 s it work? You will be put in a team with 5-6 people you don’t know. The
 re will be 2 rounds of trivia. Each round\, you will change teams! There w
 ill be a DJ In the lounge after the event so you can stay after the event 
 to keep the conversations going! What does ‘single’ mean? &#x27\;Singl
 e’ means you are open to connecting with other people for love\, lust or
  friendship. Maybe you will meet your soulmate! Maybe you will meet your n
 ew best friend! Maybe you will make out in the bathroom! Maybe you will ad
 d a lover to your rotation! Maybe you will find a gaming buddy. Queer love
  is EXPANSIVE. Let&#x27\;s be open to a variety of connections. The event 
 is poly-friendly\, slut-friendly\, monogamy-friendly\, ace-friendly. If yo
 u can’t leave your judgment of others at home\, then you should stay hom
 e. Cost We are doing a sliding scale of $7-$25. And you get a $2 credit at
  the bar with this ticket purchase! All funds are going to Glad Day Lit to
  support 2SLGBTQ artists and community events. Schedule 7:30pm - Doors Ope
 n\, you get put into your first team 8pm - First Round starts 10pm ISH - E
 xpected end\, but you can stay to socialize! How will you make the teams? 
 The teams will mostly be random. How many people can attend? Our max numbe
 r for this event is 85 people.This event can sell out and the lower price 
 tickets sell out first\, so act fast. You can email any questions to have 
 to: vip@gladday.ca ‍
LOCATION:Ground Control\, 1279 Queen St W
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/questionable---sapphic-over-30-edition-que
 er-singles-trivia-3
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
