 IZA’s signature style: witty stand-up\, celebrity roasting\, and comedic
  lipsync performances that blend pop music and pop culture with elements o
 f camp cranked to the max VIZA has been dazzling audiences across Canada w
 ith her sharp wit and even sharper tongue for over 18 years. She’s been 
