BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Pride Legacy Pageant 2026
DTSTART:20260618T210000
DTEND:20260618T210000
UID:a67742c38b5975a196b64c24fd6b08ce@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:A bevy of stunning drag artists compete across two categories 
 in the second annual Pride Legacy Pageant. Hosted by Canada’s Drag Race:
  Canada vs. the World winner Lemon\, this collaboration between Vision Dra
 g and Buddies celebrates the strong history of drag in Toronto’s Village
  and beyond\, recognizing past\, current\, and future legends of the scene
 . The winner will walk away with a $1\,000 cash prize\, and a paid perform
 ance slot at Buddies’ Tallulah’s Pride Party. The Pride Legacy Pageant
  is supported by the PrEP Clinic. Founded by Talent Agent Daniel Birnbaum\
 , in partnership with The Talent House\, Vision Drag Artists is a full ser
 vice agency representing some of the country&#x27\;s best Drag and LGBTQ2S
 IA+ Entertainers. We work with venues\, events\, and promoters worldwide b
 ooking our talent in festivals\, personal appearance\, solo tours\, colleg
 es\, corporate and private functions\, as well as on camera and endorsemen
 t deals. Vision Drag Artists is working to create a bridge between Queer A
 rt\, and industry\, by celebrating all things Drag! Queer Pride 2026 June 
 5 – 28\, 2026 WE’RE BACK DIVAS &lt\;3 It’s Queer Pride 2026 and Budd
 ies and Buddies Nightlife are teaming up to make HERstory with our messies
 t\, most maximalist Pride yet. We’ve got a full month line-up of extreme
 ly queer parties\, raves\, cabarets\, concerts\, and comedy. No matter wha
 t flavour you bring\, there’s room for you in our alphabet soup \;) Join
  us on the biggest dance floor in the village for the best of queer cultur
 e in Toronto and beyond. Thank you to our Government Partner\, Canadian He
 ritage\, and our Gold Sponsor\, Freddie\, for making the 2026 Queer Pride 
 Festival possible! ‍
LOCATION:Buddies in Bad Times\, 12 Alexander St
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/the-pride-legacy-pageant-2026
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Shen All Night
DTSTART:20260618T210000
DTEND:20260618T210000
UID:475dbe23f34780779b7275b4c21abb4b@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Taking over Caf for the 10th and biggest edition of the Shen A
 ll Night series to date This series means everything to me\, it&#x27\;s tr
 uly where it all began for me as a DJ. I launched it on Pamenar&#x27\;s ba
 ck patio without any real bookings\, selling just a dozen tickets\, and gr
 adually grew it into a sold-out night over the years. Most recently\, we t
 ook over the fallen Sounds Good for their last ever Thursday in operation\
 , sold record tickets\, and landed our first RA pick of the series Stats a
 side\, this series is where I get to play literally everything I love. The
  format was always meant to be an extended set\, usually between 6 and 9 h
 ours\, where no genre is left untouched Expect house\, funk\, disco\, high
 life\, and indie dance\, closing out with Arabic and Egyptian hits\, mashu
 ps\, and remixes Flyer by Pegah Peivandi ‍
LOCATION:Cafeteria\, 1650 Dupont Street
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/shen-all-night
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
