 ood company. Join local florist Aliza FlowerNova at Buvette Pacey for an i
 ntimate evening of curated floral arranging paired with a 3-pour wine flig
 ht\, themed as a celebration of Pride month. The colour palette runs throu
 gh everything\, pink\, blush\, and lavender from the wines to the florals 
 to the arrangement you&#x27\;ll make with your own hands. Perfect for begi
 nners and a welcome reset if you&#x27\;ve done this before. Only 15 spots 
 to keep the experience intimate. Celebrating Pride. Celebrating creativity
 . Celebrating you. What&#x27\;s included A curated 3-pour wine flight enjo
 yed throughout the evening All floral materials provided A relaxed 2 hour 
 creative experience A ceramic vase and take home arrangement ‍
