DESCRIPTION:BI-PANIC is Toronto&#x27\;s Premiere Queer Dance Party for the
  WHOLE Community and we’re teaming up with SLUR for an iconic full-venue
  pride takeover! Brought to you by Traxx N Feels and Sovereignty.FM\, a on
 e-of-a-kind night of pure bi-bauchery and BI-PANIC in the heart of Downtow
 n. Lose yourself on this open-format dancefloor and prepare to shake your 
 ass to familiar and boundless sounds. From Club Classic\, Pop Punk\, Jerse
 y Club\, Y2K Dancehall and Hip Hop edits to Footwork\, Ghetto Tech\, Bass\
 , Electronica\, Global Club\, and soooo much more! A night to remember fro
 m 10PM – 3AM\, we&#x27\;ve joined forces with our friends at SLUR to cre
 ate a two-room experience for a FULL buddies takeover! YES\, double the tr
 ouble and double the fun! P.L.U.R.R. (peace love unity respect and respons
 ibility) is in full effect. BI-PANIC is an inclusive queer space for the c
 ommunity of all identities. Come as you are. Queer Pride 2026 June 5 – 2
 8\, 2026 WE’RE BACK DIVAS &lt\;3 It’s Queer Pride 2026 and Buddies and
  Buddies Nightlife are teaming up to make HERstory with our messiest\, mos
 t maximalist Pride yet. We’ve got a full month line-up of extremely quee
 r parties\, raves\, cabarets\, concerts\, and comedy. No matter what flavo
 ur you bring\, there’s room for you in our alphabet soup \;) Join us on 
 the biggest dance floor in the village for the best of queer culture in To
 ronto and beyond. Thank you to our Government Partners\, Canadian Heritage
  and Experience Ontario\, our Platinum Sponsor\, National Bank\, and our G
 old Sponsor\, Freddie\, for making the 2026 Queer Pride Festival possible!
  ‍
