 ic\, queer energy\, performance\, and release. For one night only\, the da
 ncefloor transforms into a sweaty\, high energy celebration of queer night
 life\, freedom\, and music culture. From 10PM to 4AM expect pounding house
 \, disco grooves\, live performances\, and the kind of electric crowd that
  only Pride weekend can bring. Known for her commanding presence\, razor s
 harp humour\, and unforgettable performances\, Lushious Massacr has become
  one of the most talked about names in queer nightlife worldwide. Blending
  drag\, performance art\, chaos\, glamour\, and pure personality\, she doe
 sn’t just perform at the party — she becomes the party. Expect multipl
 e live moments throughout the night plus a limited one hour meet and greet
  experience with Lushious Massacr available for 40 guests only. Musically\
 , the night stays locked into house music all night long. Sexy rhythms\, d
 isco energy\, dark corners\, euphoric moments\, and a packed dancefloor bu
 ilt for release. No phones in the air. No standing around. Just movement\,
  connection\, sweat\, and music. Event Details June 20 10PM to 5AM Toronto
  Pride Weekend Featuring: Lushious Massacr Rosacea Cheeks Minhi Wang Live 
 performances throughout the night Limited meet and greet experience HOUSE 
 MUSIC ALL NIGHT DANCING ALL NIGHT Come early. Stay late. Lose yourself. 
 ‍
LOCATION:TBA\, Address TO BE ANNOUNCED
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/lushious-massacr-live-toronto
