SUMMARY:Queer Shorts for Palestine : Films! Drag! Artists! Vendors!
DTSTART:20260622T180000
DTEND:20260622T180000
UID:6047df721f4a9550c37b8d328e78ecb8@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a night of short films\, comedy\, drag\, artists a
 nd indie vendors. And it&#x27\;s a fundraiser! Join us at Glad Day for thi
 s year&#x27\;s global screening event of Queer Cinema for Palestine&#x27\;
 s 2026 programming featuring six incredible short films by queer\, Palesti
 nian\, and allied directors. Hosted by ANNE ALIEN &amp\; Selena Vyle in pa
 rtnership with the Help Sondos Campaign\, featuring special guest speakers
  followed by Drag\, Comedy\, Burlesque and Live Music. 6pm Doors 7pm Comed
 y &amp\; Speakers 8pm Film Screenings 9pm Performances 10:30pm Expected En
 d All proceeds fundraised will be donated to the nights six film directors
  and the Help Sondos Campaign\, supporting a family of 13 in Gaza. Shop lo
 cal vendors\, win raffles\, and visit our partners to learn about their in
 itiative and how to support their cause! Speakers include Kanna Worm\, Fou
 nder Help Sondos Campaign\, with message from Sondos &amp\; family. Joey N
 icholson-Landau and Marlee Wasser from Jews Say No To Genocide. Diana Chan
  McNally\, a City Council candidate Ward 4\, . Daniela Bonamico\, a partic
 ipant of Global Sumud Flotilla. All performance and speakers time donated 
 for free in support of the continued efforts to a liberated Palestine. All
  proceeds gathered will be donated transparently. COVID PROTOCOLS Wearing 
 a mask is encouraged at this event. The space has extra high (3 story) cei
 lings and there is a steady intake of outdoor air. Use your voice\, speak 
 up\, come out! We Dance in the Night\, and we Fight in the Day! ‍
LOCATION:Glad Day (32 Lisgar)\, 32 Lisgar
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/queer-shorts-for-palestine-films-drag-arti
 sts-vendors
