BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Politics with a Drag Queen - Toronto
DTSTART:20260623T193000
DTEND:20260623T193000
UID:0231f86f45312d3da613c6135a0ffa52@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Join Karla Marx\, Selena Vyle\, Fae Johnstone and local drag i
 cons for a night of sickening drag and fiery political advocacy. Grab the 
 Gays and Theys\, the Femmes and Thems! We are going politicking and we are
  doing it in style! Join Karla Marx (drag queen\, stand-up comedian\, and 
 history prof???)\, Toronto drag icon and fierce activist Selena Vyle\, and
  Fae Johnstone (national queer activist and political diva) for a night of
  sickening drag and fierce calls to action as we celebrate QUEER JOY with 
 the community leaders who built this scene! Let’s be real: we are under 
 attack! The world is on fire. Your landlord is jacking rent\, orange dicta
 tors are trying to end the world and all you want is some solid pizza afte
 r the gig. We’re tired of it! So what are we going to do about it? Oddly
 \, the answer is…throw the best damn talent show this town has ever seen
 ! SLAY. Join us for an informative\, hilarious\, and heart-warming event w
 ith comedy\, drag and calls to action from Karla\, fiery takes and advocac
 y options with Fae and legendary performances by local drag artists. Here
 ’s the best part: This is a fundraising show to support 3 important orga
 nizations. Queer Momentum (powering national queer advocacy)\, TransAction
  Alberta (organizing to restore rights to trans Albertans)\, and LGBT Yout
 hLine (supporting queer and trans youth across Ontario) This event is brou
 ght to you by Queer Momentum\, TransAction Alberta and Fierte Canada Pride
 \, alongside Toronto Pride. Doors at 7:30pm. Show at 8:00pm. Must be 19+. 
 ‍
LOCATION:Boutique\, 553 Church St
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/politics-with-a-drag-queen---toronto
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
