SUMMARY:Cain Culto
DTSTART:20260624T193000
DTEND:20260624T193000
UID:bc737cfdb5db1174e087193711233a46@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Join us Wednesday\, June 24 for an iconic Queer Pride headline
 r concert — Cain Culto. Cain Culto is a former worship pastor turned que
 er renegade\, blending left-field pop and hip-hop with global influences. 
 Raised in a Colombian-Nicaraguan household\, he grew up between Florida an
 d Kentucky\, absorbing salsa\, bluegrass\, and evangelical culture. After 
 leaving his acclaimed Christian band Ecclesia in 2021\, he reemerged as Ca
 in Culto — an artist reclaiming his spirituality\, sexuality\, and cultu
 ral roots. A fearless DIY auteur\, hecrafts provocative music and visuals 
 that challenge faith\, politics\, and capitalism\, fusing protest\, satire
 \, and undeniable pop magic. Queer Pride 2026 June 5 – 28\, 2026 WE’RE
  BACK DIVAS &lt\;3 It’s Queer Pride 2026 and Buddies and Buddies Nightli
 fe are teaming up to make HERstory with our messiest\, most maximalist Pri
 de yet. We’ve got a full month line-up of extremely queer parties\, rave
 s\, cabarets\, concerts\, and comedy. No matter what flavour you bring\, t
 here’s room for you in our alphabet soup \;) Join us on the biggest danc
 e floor in the village for the best of queer culture in Toronto and beyond
 . Thank you to our Government Partners\, Canadian Heritage and Experience 
 Ontario\, our Platinum Sponsor\, National Bank\, and our Gold Sponsor\, Fr
 eddie\, for making the 2026 Queer Pride Festival possible! ‍
LOCATION:Buddies in Bad Times\, 12 Alexander St
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/cain-culto
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
