 nce Packed Play Party A place for queer joys and fun toys! We&#x27\;re bac
 k at our beloved home Birdhaus! (Toronto’s safest\, sex-positive\, queer
  haven\, where aesthetic vibes are high and judgment is low) on the 25th o
 f June for our 🌈🌈🌈 Punky Pride Edition🌈🌈🌈 This is YOUR i
 nvitation to indulge in shopping for wares that are soaked in artistic fre
 edom joy\, playful exploration. Be surrounded in a room of your local dege
 nerates who are just as deviant as you are and who care about the quality 
