BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:ICONS Only: SYDNEY BLU
DTSTART:20260626T220000
DTEND:20260626T220000
UID:70f55b6e49e7618f4a25bc729637dcff@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:SYDNEY BLU | Jules Bangsworth | Slater Manzo | Kasey Riot | DJ
  RAE | JAX Toronto’s queer underground returns for the second edition of
  ICONA\, a night dedicated to dance floor liberation\, bold self-expressio
 n\, and the icons shaping underground culture. ICONS ONLY brings together 
 a lineup of boundary-pushing selectors and producers who have come to SERV
 E. Expect an unforgettable night of house\, techno\, queer energy\, and la
 te-night chaos inside one of Toronto’s most beloved dance spaces. Come d
 ressed like the main character\, because you are the main character henny.
  Advance Tickets: Early Wiggler: $25 The Wiggler: $30 Performances: 10-11 
 Jax 11-12 DJ RAE 12-1 Slater Manzo 1-2:30 SYDNEY BLU 2:30-3:30 Jules Bangs
 worth 3:30-close Kasey Riot VJ SEKS Queer-centered space Allies welcome AR
 TIST BIOS Sydney Blu @sydneyblu A globally recognized DJ\, producer\, and 
 label owner\, Sydney Blu has been a driving force in underground house and
  techno for over a decade. Known for releases on deadmau5’s mau5trap imp
 rint and her own Blu Music label\, she’s played iconic clubs and festiva
 ls worldwide while building a reputation for deep\, energetic\, and emotio
 nally charged sets. A true Canadian electronic music icon. Slater Manzo @s
 latermanzo Toronto-based producer and DJ Slater Manzo blends infectious gr
 ooves\, driving basslines\, and underground house sensibilities into high-
 energy sets designed for sweaty dance floors. Known throughout the city’
 s queer and warehouse scenes\, Manzo brings an unmistakable vibe rooted in
  rhythm\, connection\, and late-night momentum. DJ RAE @rachelmolenda DJ R
 AE delivers uplifting\, soulful\, and high-vibrational dance music experie
 nces that fuse house\, disco\, and feel-good energy. A staple within Toron
 to’s inclusive nightlife community\, RAE is known for creating spaces th
 at celebrate freedom\, joy\, movement\, and queer connection through music
 . Jax @jaxonair Jax is a Toronto-based DJ known for high-energy\, emotiona
 lly charged sets that blend house\, tech house\, Latin rhythms\, and under
 ground club energy into an unforgettable dance floor experience. A staple 
 within the city’s queer nightlife scene\, Jax brings vibrant charisma be
 hind the decks and a deep understanding of crowd connection. Kasey Riot @k
 aseyriot_ Kasey Riot is a fearless selector with a love for heavy grooves\
 , underground textures\, and emotionally charged dance floors. Blending ho
 use\, techno\, and rave-inspired sounds\, their sets are immersive\, dynam
 ic\, and built for dancers who want to lose themselves in the music. Jules
  Bangsworth @julesbangsworth ICONA Mom and DJ\, Jules has been a steady fo
 rce in Toronto’s queer nightlife scene\, she brings eclectic taste\, mag
 netic energy\, and unapologetic attitude behind the decks. Expect genre-bl
 urring selections\, playful chaos\, and a set that keeps the floor moving.
  #ICONSONLY #ICONA #QueerToronto #TorontoRaves #WiggleRoomToronto #HouseMu
 sic #Techno #QueerParty #TorontoNightlife ‍
LOCATION:Wiggle Room\, 772 Dundas St W
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/icons-only-sydney-blu
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
