 ns\, Latin club sounds and scream-out-loud anthem mixing is a wild ride. W
 e’re also bringing Pittsburgh’s @jellyfishpgh ! Together they are an u
 nstoppable\, unrelenting\, high-energy duo mixing house\, chugging 80’s 
 rhythms and global sounds that will make poppers feel like a gentle breeze
 . They blew our gay minds at last year’s Honcho Campout...and we’re so
  excited to have them and Maya entertaint you from sundown to stars out. T
 hat’s not all of course! Toronto’s Freakers Corner founder\, DJ\, part
 y monster\, Plantasia regular\, and radio host - @meagerbeaver (AKA Trustf
 all) will open the day. Expect uplifting\, float-y sounds you’ve never h
 eard before... the perfect soundtrack to start your Pride Saturday. And...
  last but not least\, I’ll round out the local lineup\, bringing you exa
 ctly what you’ve come to expect - feel-good\, vocal house bangers for LI
 VING. More fun details to be announced\, but until then\, gather your girl
