BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:SHANGO PRIDE PARTY W/ CTRLZORA (Chicago)\, Kiki LeFreak\, florasys
 tem and Hiroki
DTSTART:20260627T220000
DTEND:20260627T220000
UID:2b25f125a1f87ff3c1c230b7f84837b2@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:SHANGO PRIDE PARTY W/ CTRLZORA\, KIKI LEFREAK\, FLORASYSTEM &a
 mp\; HIROKI Shango is Toronto’s favourite underground party for the frea
 ks\, geeks\, queers\, dancers and heads! Hailing from Chicago\, CTRLZORA i
 s an event (THE COWRIE) and music curator\, producer\, artist collective c
 o-founder\, DJ\, musician\, and dance music equitist from Chicago. They ai
 m to contribute to keeping the electronica dance scene alive and soulful t
 hrough house\, techno\, jazz\, funk\, world music\, and more. CTRLZORA car
 ries a sound that cannot be confused for anything short of authentic and r
 aw\, spanning from the furthest corners of Midwestern dance music all the 
 way to the expansive sounds of the African diaspora and beyond\, often col
 laborating with the creators of the original Warehouse and Music Box Chica
 go\, and US Studios\, prior to those. Paying homage to the history and lib
 eration of music within communities of color across genres is their centra
 l focus\, alongside perpetuating the tradition of house music in its origi
 nator\, Chicago\, and black and queer culture.They&#x27\;ve spearheaded ac
 tivism efforts to preserve historical venues of Chicago like The Post and 
 The Warehouse\, pushing to keep the integrity and history of the music&#x2
 7\;s roots alive. C Zora has frequently played at Smartbar\, The Lot Radio
 \, the Silverroom Block Party\, The Frankie Knuckles Festival\, Chicago Ho
 use Music Festival\, Art Basel\, Movement Detroit Weekend\, University of 
 Chicago\, Public Records Brooklyn\, Nowadays Brooklyn\, The Post Chicago\,
  The Chicago Museum of Contemporary Art\, &amp\; Chicago Cultural Center. 
 Zora has also had the honor of playing and collaborating alongside greats 
 such as Lil Louis\, Juan Atkins\, Gene Hunt\, Glenn Underground\, Muscleca
 rs\, Timmy Regisford\, Celeste Alexandar\, and Ron Trent. Infusing their o
 wn spiritual associations with music\, Zora aims to create an energy that 
 brings somatic healing not only to themselves but also to their listeners.
  Zora shares their open love letters to music and mutual sonic communion w
 ith every crowd. Supported by Toronto locals Kiki LeFreak\, Florasystem an
 d Hiroki Thank you everyone for your continued support and your help in cr
 eating a safe and loving space for us to be free in! SHANGO is a safe spac
 e. PLUR in full effect Peace Love Unity and Respect. NO judgement\, homoph
 obia\, racism\, sexual harassment or unwanted touching 10pm to LATE 1.4 he
 rtz &amp\; the jama 961 College st w ‍
LOCATION:1point4hertz\, 961 College St
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/shango-pride-party-w-ctrlzora-chicago-kiki
 -lefreak-florasystem-and-hiroki
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
