 . We will be completely taking over Longboat Hall! 2 floors - 400 max capa
 city - You are not ready! Yes\, our tickets are still $15. Yes\, we still 
 have have a $5 vodka bar. With a line-up of artists who are shaking up the
  entertainment industry as we know it\, Underground Pride creates an unfor
 gettable night experience where the party is part of the performances and 
