BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Hedwig and the Angry Inch: The 25th Anniversary Movie Tour
DTSTART:20260628T180000
DTEND:20260628T180000
UID:3849b85dba9df6ba939d5c3aa0ba84d5@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:In 2001\, a glamorous punk-rock odyssey about identity\, reinv
 ention\, a divided self\, and an unfinished love story blazed through Sund
 ance\, where it won Best Director and the Audience Award\, and refused to 
 be forgotten. Twenty-five years later\, Hedwig and the Angry Inch returns
 —raw\, resplendent\, and more radical than ever. Join writer\, director\
 , and Golden Globe–nominated star JOHN CAMERON MITCHELL for a national a
 nniversary tour celebrating the critically-lauded\, multi-award-winning fi
 lm that redefined the movie musical and remains as angry—and ELECTRIC—
 as the day it premiered. The event includes a stunning 4K screening of the
  film—unless you live in Chicago\, where you’ll see an original 35mm p
 rint—followed by an in-person conversation with Mitchell featuring behin
 d-the-scenes stories from its creation\, audience Q&amp\;A\, and a special
  acoustic performance—with post-show meet-and-greet add-ons available. 
 ‍
LOCATION:Danforth Music Hall\, 147 Danforth Avenue
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/hedwig-and-the-angry-inch-the-25th-anniver
 sary-movie-tour
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bound
DTSTART:20260628T210000
DTEND:20260628T210000
UID:1b4745a8bc74c658ff3ed415bde3353e@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Starring: Christopher Meloni\, Gina Gershon\, Jennifer Tilly\,
  Joe Pantoliano\, John P. Ryan Corky\, a tough female ex-convict working o
 n an apartment renovation in a Chicago building\, meets a couple living ne
 xt door\, Caesar\, a paranoid mobster\, and Violet\, his seductive girlfri
 end\, who is immediately attracted to her. Stylish\, sweaty\, sultry\, sen
 sual\, and sapphic. Where else would you rather be on Pride Sunday? It’s
  a very special edition of ‘MO Evil Women with a screening of what is pr
 obably the epitome of of the “be gay\, do crime” genre.BOUND\, directe
 d by the Wachowski Sisters (The Matrix)\, is the ultimate erotic thriller 
 that posits the question -are they truly “EVIL” women if it’s just t
 wo women who decide they’d rather be together and opt to scam a man who
 ’s actually a real criminal? Jennifer Tilly (Bride of Chucky\, Real Hous
 ewives of Beverly Hills) stars as Violet\, a hot femme dating a paranoid C
 hicago mobster. Gina Gershon (Showgirls\, Face/Off) stars as Corky\, a hot
  butch ex-convict working on renovations in the apartment unit next door. 
